+Public distribution: [source on main](https://github.com/jrdntnnr/sardab/tree/main),
+[emulator](https://jrdntnnr.github.io/sardab/webapp/emulator/) and
+[installer](https://jrdntnnr.github.io/sardab/webapp/installer/).
